+            <div class="bean-art" role="img" aria-label="暖橙色标签的山野咖啡豆牛皮纸包装"><span class="batch">SINGLE ORIGIN / 02</span><div class="bag"><div class="bag-label"><span class="bag-brand">栖豆</span><span class="bag-english">QIDOU COFFEE</span><div class="bag-band"><strong>山 野</strong><span>COLOMBIA · HUILA<br>200g / WHOLE BEAN</span></div></div></div><span class="art-corner">SWEET &amp; BALANCED</span></div>
+            <div class="bean-topline"><h3>山野 · 哥伦比亚</h3><span class="roast">中度烘焙</span></div><p class="origin">COLOMBIA / WASHED</p><p class="tasting">红苹果 · 焦糖 · 杏仁</p><div class="bean-bottom"><span class="price">¥ 78 <small>/ 200g</small></span><span>温柔平衡，恰到好处的甜</span></div><details><summary>风味与冲煮建议</summary><p>水洗处理，果实甜感与坚果香气相伴。建议手冲：15g 咖啡粉搭配 225g 水，水温 88–91°C；也适合爱乐压，享受更圆润的口感。</p></details>
+          </article>
+          <article class="bean-card">
+            <div class="bean-art" role="img" aria-label="深灰蓝色标签的日常拼配咖啡豆牛皮纸包装"><span class="batch">HOUSE BLEND / 03</span><div class="bag"><div class="bag-label"><span class="bag-brand">栖豆</span><span class="bag-english">QIDOU COFFEE</span><div class="bag-band"><strong>日 常</strong><span>SIGNATURE HOUSE BLEND<br>200g / WHOLE BEAN</span></div></div></div><span class="art-corner">RICH &amp; COMFORTING</span></div>
+            <div class="bean-topline"><h3>日常 · 招牌拼配</h3><span class="roast">中深度烘焙</span></div><p class="origin">BRAZIL &amp; COLOMBIA / BLEND</p><p class="tasting">黑巧克力 · 烤榛果 · 太妃糖</p><div class="bean-bottom"><span class="price">¥ 68 <small>/ 200g</small></span><span>醇厚扎实，牛奶的好搭档</span></div><details><summary>风味与冲煮建议</summary><p>以巴西与哥伦比亚咖啡豆拼配，口感醇厚。意式浓缩可从 18g 粉、36g 咖啡液、25–30 秒开始调整；加入牛奶，感受巧克力与太妃糖风味。</p></details>
+          </article>
+        </div>
+      </section>
+    </div>
