+          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 3c1 5-5 6-3 10 1 1 3-1 3-3 7 5 6 11-1 11C4 21 2 14 7 9c-1 4 1 5 2 4"/></svg>小批量新鲜烘焙</span>
+          <span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8h13v7a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H9a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V8Zm13 1h2a3 3 0 0 1 0 6h-2M7 3v2m5-2v2M3 23h16"/></svg>分享每一杯日常</span>
